  "content": {
    "title": "Rapper Latto reveals pregnancy, new album on Instagram",
    "text": "Updated March 20, 2026, 10:23 a.m. ETGrammy-nominated rapper Latto announced that she's pregnant in a series of Instagram posts and on her newly released single \"Business & Personal\".The rapper, also known as Alyssa Michelle Stephens, confirmed the release date of her album \"Big Mama\" which is set to be released on May 29.At the beginning of her music video, Latto shows off her baby bump, a nursery, and includes home videos from her childhood.\"Maybach that’s the Benz of the day, car seat got a kid on the way,\" she raps in one of her verses.The official music video for her single \"Business & Personal\" is available on YouTube.Here's what to know about Latto's pregnancy announcement.Latto unveils pregnancy news on InstagramOn Instagram, Latto posted a photo of herself carrying a baby cheetah with her baby bump. In the caption, she mentioned the new album, song, and video.Latto also posted a clip of the music video \"Business & Personal,\" including the verse where she announced she has a \"kid on the way.\"Hours before her announcement, she posted a video teasing the announcement, prompting fans to speculate in the comment section.The rapper also hopped on Instagram Live shortly after she confirmed the news, talking to fans and showing off her baby bump.Fans, other celebs congratulate LattoFans and celebs alike have taken to Latto's comment section on the post announcing the pregnancy to congratulate her.50 Cent, SZA, and other female rappers like JT and Monaleo all commented, offering their well-wishes. WNBA superstar Angel Reese chimed in saying, \"ahhhh big mommyyyyy!! so happy for you!! 🥺🤍\"\"I’m screaming!🥳\" wrote one user. \"Congratulations, boo bae!\"\"I need to be at the baby shower,\" said another. This story has been updated with new information.Julia Gomez is a Trending reporter for USA TODAY and covers popular toys, scientific studies, natural disasters, holidays, and trending news. Connect with her on LinkedIn, X, Instagram, and TikTok: @juliamariegz, or email her at jgomez@gannett.com.",
